# Keep dev-only scaffolding out of the ZIP that GitHub serves.
#
# `git archive` (which powers github.com/<repo>/zipball/HEAD — the archive that
# usethis::use_course() downloads, and the "Download ZIP" button) honours
# `export-ignore`, so files marked below are stripped from that ZIP while staying
# fully versioned in the repo. Participants who `use_course()` get only the
# workshop materials; the dev scaffold stays behind the curtain.
#
# NOTE: this affects archives only, NOT `git clone` — a clone still gets
# everything. The recommended path in setup.qmd is use_course(), which is clean.

/.claude          export-ignore
/.vscode          export-ignore
/_publish.yml     export-ignore
/.gitattributes   export-ignore
